# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REELS: commit the reproducible DEFINITION so others can re-render or adapt —
#   beat_sheet.json, source text, and the curated character REFERENCE images.
# Exclude the heavy, regenerable OUTPUT — rendered video, narration audio,
#   storyboard stills, and reference candidates (the rejects).
# (git .gitignore does NOT support inline comments — keep patterns bare.)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Regenerable / heavy output dirs (anywhere)
# stills/ = full-res PNG working masters (local only); the small committed JPGs
# live in each reel's discord/ folder (export_discord.sh).
**/stills/
**/out/
**/mp3/
**/candidates/

# Old stray local dir (root only)
/characters/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rendered / heavy media by extension (never commit)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aiff
*.flac
*.ogg
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz

# Images: PNG is the large local working master (FLUX/SoulID 2K output) — do NOT commit.
# JPG is the committed repo format (stills + references, converted from PNG; ~20x smaller).
*.png
*.gif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.psd
# (*.jpg / *.jpeg / *.webp are NOT ignored — they commit)
!docs/**/*.png
!examples/**/*.png

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets (never commit)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.key
**/secrets*
higgsfield.txt

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / Remotion
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.remotion/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor / packaged skills
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.skill
/fonts/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vox-explainer: machine-owned / regenerable (slot contract: clips/ is
# recompiled from inputs; media/ is Manim's render cache)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/clips/
**/media/texts/
**/media/videos/

# OAuth credentials — NEVER in this (public) repo; live in ../../publish-workspace/
client_secret*.json
youtube_token*.json
youtube_publish_ledger*.json
